                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 华文中宋;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;">
</p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一年工作接近尾声，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>元旦钟声即将敲响，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>新的一年就要来临。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>回顾绍兴一中2023年的工作，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>我们梳理了十大亮点，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>向您报告！</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.特色创新，学校发展稳步前行</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校立足科技高中定位，创新人才培养模式，获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市分类办学特色示范校，</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">入选</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第二期北京大学博雅人才共育基地、清华大学生源中学名单，</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">先后获得</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>浙江大学“首批人才共育基地”、南京大学“优质生源基地”、西安交通大学 “2023 年优秀学生标兵生源基地”授牌</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；稳步推进“八大中心、三大智能化支持平台”建设，升级数字校园，探索推进数字化改革，获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市智慧校园标杆校；</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持五育并举，立德树人，学校团委获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“全国五四红旗团委”</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，为本次绍兴市</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>唯一</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，学校获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市德育先进集体；</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">积极推进文明校园建设，入选</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>浙江省百优“无废城市细胞”</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">名单。本年度，学校党建、教学、德育、安全等多线块工作继续</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">取得优秀成绩，在</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>市直学校年度考核中连续第四年获评一等奖</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.品牌打造，党建引领激发活力</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在市委、市教育局党委统一部署下，深入开展</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育，</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在循迹溯源、学思践悟中不断提升治理能力，推进学校发展。围绕“治新学、育新人、涵新知、树新风、建新功”五大主题，系统打造</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“养新”党建品牌</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。进一步强化师德师风建设，开展师德师风问题专项整治工作自查自纠，组织全体教师学习“最美教师”先进事迹，开展“我的教育生涯”师德师风主题征文活动，讴歌师德典范，厚植高尚师德。打磨</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“求真”清廉文化品牌</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>浙江省廉洁教育基地</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并作为中学</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>唯一代表</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，参加中央纪委监委来绍调研组座谈会并发言，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学校工作经验《“五廉一体”推进“求真”清廉品牌建设》受到中纪委肯定，并收录进相关调研成果</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.追求卓越，教学业绩稳步提升</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今年，我校高考成绩卓越，特控线上线人数</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>588</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，特控线上线率</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>83%</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，一本学校录取</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>716</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，一本录取率</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>99%</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。清北复交以上名校录取</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>27</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，C9层次高校录取</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>83</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，顶尖体艺学校录取</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>14</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，其中包括中国美院5人、北影1人、北体1人，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位高二学生被</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>西湖大学录取</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位高二学生和</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位高一学生被</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>中国科学技术大学少创班录取</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，人数</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>创历史新高并全省领先</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，整体成绩取得新突破。竞赛再创佳绩，</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第27届国际天文奥林匹克竞赛</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中，</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>周泽震</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">斩获一枚</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>国际金牌</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这是我校累计获得的第</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>14</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">枚国际金牌。全年各学科竞赛共取得全国金牌</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>11</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">枚，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人入选国家集训队，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人入选国家队，取得省一等奖</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>78</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">个，一等奖人数</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>创历史新高</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>科课互长</strong></span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>，人才培养</strong></span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>走通新路</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为全国首批“北斗科普基地”，着力“科（技）课（程）互长”协同创新，推进“北斗元培学苑”建设，强化科技创新拔尖人才培养。3月，我校接连受邀参加北京大学、浙江大学、国防科技大学、浙江大学、南开大学等先后组织的</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 15pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“基础学科拔尖创新人才选拔与培养”专题研讨会</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；4月，我校受邀参加</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 15pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第十三届中国卫星导航年会</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，出席“北斗教育论坛”，并做《基于资源共享人才共育的未来技术领军人才的培养实践》专题报告。学校以各类青少年科技赛事为抓手，深入推进科技特色教育：组建</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 15pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>13支</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">队伍参加全国青少年航天创新大赛，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 15pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全部获奖，3人获一等奖</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；遴选学生参加第十四届“北斗杯”全国青少年空天科技体验与创新大赛，</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>赵静怡、何飞、赵奕铭</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">实物作品和</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>彭浩洋、夏泽锴、俞弘毅</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">科技小论文 ,</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>双双</strong></span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>荣获</strong></span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全国</strong></span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>总决赛一等奖</strong></span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第一名！</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.全国领先，信奥教育再攀高峰</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为全国信息学奥林匹克“特色学校”和“基地学校”，我校</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>成功申办2025年第42届全国青少年信息学奥林匹克竞赛（NOI）</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，成为</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全国唯一</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一所</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三度</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">承办此竞赛的高中。</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本年度，信息学竞赛成果丰硕：在</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第40届全国青少年信息学奥林匹克竞赛</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中，取得</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2金2银1铜</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，金牌获得者</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>翟锦程、徐睿</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">取得</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>北京大学保送资格；</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2023年全国信息学奥林匹克联赛（NOIP2023）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中，取得</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>6人满分、35个全国一等奖</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的好成绩，一等奖人数</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全国第一</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；在</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2023年全国信息学奥林匹克CSP竞赛</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中，取得</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>34个全国一等奖</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的好成绩，一等奖人数</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全省第一</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。11月，北京大学“图灵班”建设成果总结会暨计算机学科拔尖人才培养论坛邀请我校参加，根据北京大学数据反馈，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>我校在北京大学“图灵班”全体生源情况、信奥国家集训队生源情况中均位列全国前2位！</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>6.润德育心，博雅品牌培育新人</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 19.2pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本年度，学校获评2022学年</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“市级德育工作优秀集体”“市直学校德育工作优秀集体”</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等多项荣誉，承办省级现场活动</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2023年浙江省“18岁成人礼”宣誓仪式。</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">重视从“大德育”视角建设博雅德育品牌，丰富学生“第二课堂”，举办校园</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>艺术节、学术节</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，创新举办</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>首届话剧节</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，实施以项目化学习为核心的职业体验活动，探索出了一条</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“职业体验+劳动教育”</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">有机整合之路。成立学生发展指导中心，创建</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>校本学生发展智能化指导平台</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，“问诊式处方法”路径解决学生个性需求问题，助力学生生涯发展。组织遴选聘任</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第七届“学生校长助理”</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，充分发挥学生的主人翁意识；落实评选</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2023年度“十佳博雅少年”</strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">,展现新时代新青年热爱国家、自立自强、奋发向上的精神风貌。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>7.院士领航，科学素养助力成长</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 19.2pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">邀</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">请南京大学、同济大学、中国科学技术大学等多位高校专家、学者来校开展</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“博雅大讲堂”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">系列讲座</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>20余场</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并积极推动</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“院士科普进校园”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活动，利用开学典礼契机，精心组织“开学第一课”，中国工程院院士、卫星导航系统总体设计专家</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>谭述森</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授为一中学子殷切寄语，中国工程院院士、航天工程技术专家</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>龙乐豪</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为同学们开展新学期“博雅大讲堂”第一讲，中科院院士、西湖大学校长</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>施一公</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来校谈“科技强国与拔尖创新人才培养”，培养学生探索科学的兴趣，坚定科技报国的决心。今年9月，我校1985届校友、世界著名物理学家</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>叶军</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">院士回访母校，并捐资一百万元人民币设立</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“叶军奖学金”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。学校被授牌为</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“浙江院士科普基地”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市“科学家故事众创空间”创新试点培育校。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>8.喜迎亚运，阳光体艺展现风采</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今年，杭州亚运会和亚残运会盛大举行。我校</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>孟德超</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>先后在杭州亚运会、亚残运会的田径赛场上担任裁判</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，为盛会贡献力量。我校奥运冠军</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>蒋裕燕</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在杭州亚残运会上，勇夺</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>7金1铜</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，成为本届盛会获</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>金牌和奖牌数量最多</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的运动员，并担任闭幕式</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>中国体育代表团旗手</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。围绕“喜迎亚运”主题，我校携手结对学校</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港仁济医院罗陈楚思中学，</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">切实开展</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">交流活动</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，被省教育厅评为</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“亚运姊妹学校”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；扎实推进“五育并举”，创优阳光体艺，举办春季体测运动会、秋季运动会、艺术节等系列活动。在市直田径运动会上，取得</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>团体总分第一名</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，市直羽毛球、排球、乒乓球等比赛均获优异成绩。校棒垒球队获</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">省</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青少年垒球锦标赛</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第四名</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人获评一级运动员，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>8人</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">获评二级运动员。</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>胡沁文</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学获省青少年田径锦标赛标枪业余组女子</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第一名</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。我校美育社团参与</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>市“百佳”美育特色社团展览</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，美术组王宁老师荣获省中小学美术教师基本功比武</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全能一等奖</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和单项色彩创作比赛</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第一名</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>9.研思不辍，专业发展凸显成效</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全年承办</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>省、市两级学科研讨活动4场</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，举办第二届</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“教科节”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活动，强化“课堂教学比武”“命题说题比赛”，展现过硬教师素养和良好教研氛围。加强省内外学校交流合作：与</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学、青田中学、灵溪中学</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等开展</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“县中崛起”结对帮扶</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；与</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北师大附中、金融街杭州湾学校等</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组建</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五校共同体</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；强化与</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杭州二中、温州中学、金华一中</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“四校联盟”合作</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，深化“融杭联甬”举措，拓宽教育教学视野，促进教师专业发展，推动教育创新。本年度，我校获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市教科研先进集体</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，物理教研组获评</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市先进教研组</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #0000FF;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>叶望尧</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师新评为正高级教师，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>30多</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位老师在市教育教学论文评比、市精品选修课程、市教科规划课题优秀成果评比中获奖，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>10多</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">项课题在省教育信息化研究课题和市教科规划课题中立项。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>10.实用一流，龙山书院精心筹建</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在市教育局关心重视和协调组织下，龙山书院筹建工作领导小组在我校设立“筹建办”，下设8个工作小组高效有序推动龙山书院筹建工作。坚持</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“实用”“一流”并重</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的要求，落实设施、师资按一流配备；在兼顾特色与传承的同时，统筹一中与龙山的建设，统筹招生与招师，统筹搭班子与带团队。今年上半年，龙山书院已完成投资额2.33亿元，累计完成投资额9.73亿元。东侧演艺中心、初中部、培训中心、教师公寓等大楼外立面施工完成，总形象进度达72%。项目土建工程预计今年底基本完成。目前，龙山书院建设已进入设施设备项目采购工作。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>每一项成绩的取得，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>都包含着一中人的汗水与拼搏，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>离不开全体家长、校友的理解与配合，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>更承载着各级领导的指导与关心，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>以及社会各界的包容与支持。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>龙行龘龘开新景，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>展望2024新的一年，</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>我们继续勇毅前行，共赴精彩未来！</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>
</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056150516.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056150516.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056158506.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056158506.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056154559.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056154559.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056159514.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056159514.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056150321.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056150321.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056150080.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056150080.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056160928.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056160928.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056165341.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056165341.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056161059.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056161059.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056163138.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056163138.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056169544.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056169544.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056169644.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056169644.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/1/202401101056164299.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202401101056164299.png" /></p><p style="font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14pt; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>
</strong></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
